  <p>No landscape set-up is needed for these four. TikTok accepts 16:9 and 1:1 in-feed and Douyin in-feed accepts 16:9 on 4 of 4 sources, and both are optional.</p>

  <p>The one timing figure on the Western side that is worth planning around comes from TikTok, and TikTok labels it advice.</p>

  <blockquote class="evidence">TikTok's creative guidance for performance ads recommends landing the content proposition in the first 3 seconds and the hook in the first 6. It lists vertical 9:16, at least 720p and sound as basics. These are the platform's recommendations, not measured results.</blockquote>
  <p class="source">Source: TikTok ads help center, creative best practices for performance ads, updated June 2025, read 10 and 15 September 2026. Primary reading of the platform's guidance, which labels the timings as recommendations.</p>

  <p>hubStudio produces the Western half on the terms the <a href="/solutions/platforms/tiktok">TikTok platform page</a> and the <a href="/solutions/platforms/meta">Meta platform page</a> set out. The <a href="/solutions/platforms/douyin">Douyin platform page</a> and the <a href="/solutions/platforms/rednote">RedNote platform page</a> do the same for the Chinese half. Between them sits the variant set, which the <a href="/services/design/ad-creative">ad creative design service page</a> covers, and the <a href="/resources/insights/one-shoot-six-platforms-china-variant-matrix">China variant matrix</a> carries the same master on to WeChat and Weibo.</p>

  <blockquote class="evidence">hubStudio sends a binding proposal within 48 hours of receiving a brief.</blockquote>
